          "path": "_m/c/2/1/5/multnomah-falls-wp/little-multnomah-10259516684.jpg",
          "filename": "Little Multnomah (10259516684).jpg",
          "caption": "When enjoying the view of the Columbia River from the Multnomah Falls upper viewpoint the beauty doesn’t stop there.  All you need to do is turn around and you can enjoy this lovely cascade.  Simply named “Little Multnomah” it is often overlooked due to the fact that most visitors are preoccupied with the main view of the gorge.  Especially during the summer months when the water level drops and Little Multnomah isn’t quite as noticeable.",
